{"version":1,"content":"<p>據The Decoder報道，前OpenAI研究員、美國德克薩斯大學奧斯汀分校教授斯科特·阿倫森（Scott Aaronson）近日發表文章稱，<strong>相比證明黎曼猜想本身，AI能夠獨立完成這類高難度數學證明，才是真正值得關注的突破，其影響可能涉及全球經濟乃至人類生存。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588158.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.357068+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.412630+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.412630+00:00","content_hash":"f5a9a701a1cbffc620313d3a1241f3871ccf4cc4b028578d33565794422d02dc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}